{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>האלה ואמרו רק עם</b> ס\"ת מקוה (ס\"ת = samech-tav: the letters samech and tav close and open the phrase). ר\"ת ערוה (ר\"ת = rashei tevot: רק עם = ערוה). Why is the nakedness of his sister forbidden yet the nakedness of his brother's daughter permitted? And why does a ritual bath of forty se'ah purify, but if a kortov is lacking it does not purify? רק — it is a minuation: they do not know the reason for kil'ayim and the red heifer and similar things."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:08:44.919151620Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}